  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> undergoes simple harmonic motion with a period <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> and an amplitude <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span>. What is the magnitude of the net force acting on the particle at the instant its displacement from the equilibrium position is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{A}{2}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4\\pi^2 m A}{T^2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2\\pi^2 m A}{T^2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi^2 m A}{T^2}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi^2 m A}{2T^2}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
